{"id":"eafb5a2123c30027","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-recursive-path-order.md","title":"RPO","display":"RPO","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","display":"RPO","label":"56-df-recursive-path-order","aliases":["56-df-recursive-path-order"],"type":"definition","depends_on":["[[56-df-terms]]","[[56-df-size]]","[[56-df-lexicographic-extension]]","[[56-df-reduction-order]]"],"source_section":"6.4.16–6.4.27","source_pages":"218–222","source_ocr_blocks":[239,240,241,242,243],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"display","html":"RPO"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-recursive-path-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-recursive-path-order</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"54b191461f9c19db\" href=\"?note=54b191461f9c19db\" title=\"56-df-size\">56-df-size</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"45ad3c4764af1fc0\" href=\"?note=45ad3c4764af1fc0\" title=\"56-df-lexicographic-extension\">56-df-lexicographic-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ea6d0d000271b1cf\" href=\"?note=ea6d0d000271b1cf\" title=\"56-df-reduction-order\">56-df-reduction-order</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.4.16–6.4.27"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"218–222"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>239</span><span>240</span><span>241</span><span>242</span><span>243</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\succ\\subseteq F^2\">\\(\\succ\\subseteq F^2\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(F,\\succ)\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(F,\\succ)\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}\\mathrm{Stat}_{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}\\mathrm{Stat}_{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq T^2\">\\(Q\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|t|\">\\(|t|\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"54b191461f9c19db\" href=\"?note=54b191461f9c19db\" title=\"56-df-size\">56-df-size</a> 的有限项大小；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=f(\\vec s)\">\\(s=f(\\vec s)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec s\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}\">\\(\\vec s\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}\\)</span>，同样使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=g(\\vec t)\">\\(t=g(\\vec t)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lift}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lift}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"45ad3c4764af1fc0\" href=\"?note=45ad3c4764af1fc0\" title=\"56-df-lexicographic-extension\">56-df-lexicographic-extension</a>。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(Q)\">\\(\\Phi(Q)\\)</span> 的内部递归按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|s|+|t|\">\\(|s|+|t|\\)</span> 作良基递归，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 只作为 status 提升的已给定关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;_{\\mathrm{rpo}}\">\\(&gt;_{\\mathrm{rpo}}\\)</span> 的所有参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau)\">\\((\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\ns\\;\\Phi(Q)\\;t\\iff\\exists f\\in F\\;\\exists\\vec s\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}\\;\\bigl[s=f(\\vec s)\\land\n\\bigl(&amp;\\exists i\\in[\\mathrm{ar}(f)]\\;(s_i=t\\lor s_i\\Phi(Q)t)\\\\\n\\lor\\;&amp;\\exists g\\in F\\;\\exists\\vec t\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}(g)}\\;[\nt=g(\\vec t)\\land\\forall j\\in[\\mathrm{ar}(g)]\\;s\\Phi(Q)t_j\\\\\n&amp;\\land(f\\succ g\\lor(f=g\\land\n(\\vec s,\\vec t)\\in\\mathrm{Lift}_{T,\\mathrm{ar}(f)}(Q,\\tau(f))))]\\bigr)\\bigr],\\\\\nP_0&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\qquad P_{k+1}:=\\Phi(P_k)\\quad(k\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n&gt;_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}P_k.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\ns\\;\\Phi(Q)\\;t\\iff\\exists f\\in F\\;\\exists\\vec s\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}\\;\\bigl[s=f(\\vec s)\\land\n\\bigl(&amp;\\exists i\\in[\\mathrm{ar}(f)]\\;(s_i=t\\lor s_i\\Phi(Q)t)\\\\\n\\lor\\;&amp;\\exists g\\in F\\;\\exists\\vec t\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}(g)}\\;[\nt=g(\\vec t)\\land\\forall j\\in[\\mathrm{ar}(g)]\\;s\\Phi(Q)t_j\\\\\n&amp;\\land(f\\succ g\\lor(f=g\\land\n(\\vec s,\\vec t)\\in\\mathrm{Lift}_{T,\\mathrm{ar}(f)}(Q,\\tau(f))))]\\bigr)\\bigr],\\\\\nP_0&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\qquad P_{k+1}:=\\Phi(P_k)\\quad(k\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n&gt;_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}P_k.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 Definitions 6.4.16、6.4.20，而非在未定义的序上直接循环调用“multiset order”。Φ 的内部递归每次至少把一个项换成真子项，故项对大小严格下降；外层由自然数递归及集合并构成。Propositions 6.4.17–6.4.22 证明各阶段为严格序、阶段单调并给出极限严格序；6.4.27 证明极限满足通常的 RPO 递归刻画。已读这些构造与证明。良基 precedence 只在证明所得序良基时需要，定义本身对任意严格 precedence 有意义。这里保留原书严格序版本；不把多重集相等的不同项暗中认作等价。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.4.16–6.4.27，印刷页 218–222。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-size","status":"resolved","id":"54b191461f9c19db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lexicographic-extension","status":"resolved","id":"45ad3c4764af1fc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lexicographic-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"ea6d0d000271b1cf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-reduction-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-size","status":"resolved","id":"54b191461f9c19db","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$；$\\succ\\subseteq F^2$ 满足 $\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(F,\\succ)$。取 $\\tau\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}\\mathrm{Stat}_{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}$、$Q\\subseteq T^2$、$s,t\\in T$。$|t|$ 为 [[56-df-size]] 的有限项大小；$s=f(\\vec s)$ 表示 $f\\in F$、$\\vec s\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}$，同样使用 $t=g(\\vec t)$。$\\mathrm{Lift}$ 见 [[56-df-lexicographic-extension]]。以下 $\\Phi(Q)$ 的内部递归按 $|s|+|t|$ 作良基递归，$Q$ 只作为 status 提升的已给定关系；$>_{\\mathrm{rpo}}$ 的所有参数为 $(\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau)$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lexicographic-extension","status":"resolved","id":"45ad3c4764af1fc0","anchor":"ref-6","t